"brxe-bswyjx" class="brxe-divider horizontal"><div class="line"></div></div><span id="brxe-64xg5z" class="brxe-text-basic nv-section-eyebrow-text">La Visione Estetica di Nicole Vinti</span></div><h2 id="brxe-oqfi57" class="brxe-heading nv-essenza-quote-title">Parrucchieri Professionisti e Consulenza d’Immagine: L'Arte del Taglio Capelli Donna</h2></div><div id="brxe-4m1muf" class="brxe-div nv-essenza-paragraphs"><p id="brxe-8n5qqr" class="brxe-text-basic">Con oltre 35 anni di carriera tra passerelle d'alta moda, backstage per i <strong>migliori parrucchieri a Milano</strong> e Parigi e la guida del suo salone di <strong>parrucchieri a Gallarate per donna</strong>, <strong>Nicole Vinti</strong> ha forgiato un metodo esclusivo di <strong>consulenza d'immagine</strong>&nbsp;che supera le mode passeggere.</p><p id="brxe-jca164" class="brxe-text-basic">Ogni <strong>taglio di capelli donna</strong> è un'opera su misura. Che tu desideri un <strong>taglio corto donna </strong>di carattere, un<strong> taglio medio</strong> dinamico o valorizzare i tuoi <strong>capelli ricci </strong>e lunghi, armonizziamo le proporzioni del volto con <strong>effetti luce sui capelli</strong>, <strong>balayage</strong>, <strong>shatush </strong>e trattamenti <strong>gloss hair</strong>.</p></div><div id="brxe-hph6e8" class="brxe-div nv-essenza-features-grid"><div id="brxe-16hrrn" class="brxe-div nv-feature-item"><span id="brxe-bgbnch" class="brxe-text-basic nv-feature-icon">✓</span><div id="brxe-8d81qm" class="brxe-div"><p id="brxe-u5tlbm" class="brxe-text-basic nv-feature-title">Ascolto</p><p id="brxe-wga41x" class="brxe-text-basic nv-feature-desc">Colloquio preventivo privo di fretta per comprendere bisogni e desideri.</p></div></div><div id="brxe-eesy0d" class="brxe-div nv-feature-item"><span id="brxe-riftef" class="brxe-text-basic nv-feature-icon">✓</span><div id="brxe-nzcmyl" class="brxe-div"><p id="brxe-awh5z0" class="brxe-text-basic nv-feature-title">Materia Viva</p><p id="brxe-3pcxab" class="brxe-text-basic nv-feature-desc">Rispetto assoluto della fibra biologica con ingredienti biodinamici.</p></div></div></div><div id="brxe-81ojix" class="brxe-div nv-essenza-action-wrapper"><a id="brxe-3xjar4" class="brxe-text-link nv-essenza-link" href="https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/contatti/">Richiedi una consulenza diretta con Nicole →</a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="video-reel" class="brxe-section nv-reel-section brx-animated" data-bricks-import-scope-grxorv="" data-interactions="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ncbtzz&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;enterView&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;startAnimation&quot;,&quot;animationDuration&quot;:&quot;2s&quot;,&quot;runOnce&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;animationType&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}]" data-interaction-id="dee317" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1" data-animation-id="ncbtzz" style=""><div id="brxe-mojj2h" class="brxe-container nv-reel-container"><div id="brxe-r9tpp1" class="brxe-div nv-section-header-split"><div id="brxe-fn1fyw" class="brxe-div"><div id="brxe-mh1i8s" class="brxe-div nv-section-eyebrow-wrapper"><span id="brxe-bkqw6g" class="brxe-div nv-section-eyebrow-line"><div id="brxe-lttxbz" class="brxe-divider horizontal"><div class="line"></div></div></span><span id="brxe-aa3pg0" class="brxe-text-basic nv-section-eyebrow-text">Dietro le Quinte dell'Arte</span></div><h2 id="brxe-p9ogil" class="brxe-heading nv-section-main-title">L'Esperienza in Salone — Guarda il Video Reel</h2></div></div><div id="brxe-g6a7jw" class="brxe-div nv-reel-content-grid"><div id="brxe-yyhioq" class="brxe-div nv-reel-player-col"><div id="brxe-9g7v4g" class="brxe-div nv-reel-card"><div id="brxe-nmvgbg" data-script-id="nmvgbg" class="brxe-video"><div loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" tabindex="-1" title="Nicole Vinti" data-iframe-src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/y2Y3lPw_f9I?wmode=opaque&amp;rel=0&amp;enablejsapi=1&amp;origin=https%3A%2F%2F100100siti.it&amp;hl=it&amp;cc_lang_pref=it&amp;color=white&amp;playsinline=1" class="bricks-video-preview-image" style="background-image: url(https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Copertina.png);"></div><div class="bricks-video-overlay"></div><i class="fas fa-play bricks-video-overlay-icon" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="play"></i></div><div id="brxe-ra31u6" class="brxe-div nv-reel-overlay-gradient"></div><div id="brxe-0srk4t" class="brxe-div nv-reel-top-badges"><span id="brxe-e17vgx" class="brxe-text-basic nv-reel-badge-exclusive">Reel</span><div id="brxe-d9j8e2" class="brxe-div nv-reel-badge-duration"><span id="brxe-9p0vye" class="brxe-text-basic nv-reel-duration-icon">⏱</span><span id="brxe-4gmfn4" class="brxe-text-basic">00:16 min</span></div></div><div id="brxe-jhem6k" class="brxe-div nv-reel-bottom-info"><div id="brxe-wthe18" class="brxe-div nv-reel-audio-tag"><span id="brxe-7r4j0y" class="brxe-text-basic">Guarda il reel</span></div><p id="brxe-mbk1ow" class="brxe-text-basic nv-reel-info-title">Dalla consulenza d'immagine al taglio di capelli donna con Nicole Vinti.</p><p id="brxe-djjkok" class="brxe-text-basic nv-reel-info-sub">@nicolevinti_official • Concept Store Gallarate (VA)</p></div></div></div><div id="brxe-stanu2" class="brxe-div nv-reel-steps-col"><div id="brxe-whdrd8" class="brxe-div nv-reel-steps-header"><span id="brxe-jt28vq" class="brxe-text-basic nv-reel-steps-eyebrow">I Passaggi Chiave del Salone</span><h3 id="brxe-zdxy1e" class="brxe-heading nv-reel-steps-title">La danza della forma: come prende vita un total look che si distingue.</h3><p id="brxe-2zk5ap" class="brxe-text-basic nv-reel-steps-desc">Nei passaggi successivi puoi scoprire i 3 momenti con cui accogliamo ogni cliente nel nostro salone di  <strong>parrucchiere a Gallarate</strong>: non semplici fasi tecniche, ma un sistema pensato dai nostri <strong>parrucchieri professionisti</strong> per armonizzare i lineamenti e rigenerare la mente.</p></div><div id="brxe-n31kwh" class="brxe-div nv-reel-steps-list"><div id="brxe-dm8ltb" class="brxe-div nv-step-card"><span id="brxe-wabfl9" class="brxe-text-basic nv-step-number">01</span><div id="brxe-as6ux0" class="brxe-div"><h4 id="brxe-3ylere" class="brxe-heading nv-step-title">Diagnosi e Mappatura Fisionomica</h4><p id="brxe-avnj8x" class="brxe-text-basic nv-step-desc">Studio dell'ovale, della postura e della caduta naturale delle ciocche prima di iniziare qualsiasi detersione o trattamento.</p></div></div><div id="brxe-04wpls" class="brxe-div nv-step-card"><span id="brxe-lfukhx" class="brxe-text-basic nv-step-number">02</span><div id="brxe-jpoml8" class="brxe-div"><h4 id="brxe-kva692" class="brxe-heading nv-step-title">Rituale Olistico Hair SPA al Lavatesta</h4><p id="brxe-npf6sb" class="brxe-text-basic nv-step-desc">Massaggio cutaneo polisensoriale con oli essenziali biologici e panni caldi profumati per decontrarre collo e cuoio capelluto.</p></div></div><div id="brxe-6y8ff5" class="brxe-div nv-step-card"><span id="brxe-7h17qm" class="brxe-text-basic nv-step-number">03</span><div id="brxe-wsu1gr" class="brxe-div"><h4 id="brxe-2e1hci" class="brxe-heading nv-step-title">Taglio Sartoriale a Capello Naturale</h4><p id="brxe-kte1s6" class="brxe-text-basic nv-step-desc">Scolpitura a forbice millimetrica a capello asciutto per calibrare i volumi reali e garantire una gestione spontanea a casa.</p></div></div></div><div id="brxe-vu6enc" class="brxe-div nv-reel-actions"><a id="brxe-slp0cu" class="brxe-button nv-hero-btn-primary bricks-button" href="https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/prenota-ora/">Prenota la Tua Esperienza</a><a id="brxe-tnz0n1" class="brxe-text-link nv-essenza-link" href="https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/galleria/">Scopri la nostra gallery →</a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="nv-filosofia-section" class="brxe-section nv-filosofia-section brx-animated" data-bricks-import-scope-grxorv="" data-interactions="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;bivmfl&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;enterView&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;startAnimation&quot;,&quot;animationDuration&quot;:&quot;2s&quot;,&quot;runOnce&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;animationType&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}]" data-interaction-id="47ce61" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1" data-animation-id="bivmfl" style=""><div id="brxe-tneazj" class="brxe-container nv-filosofia-container"><div id="brxe-esz9se" class="brxe-div nv-filosofia-top-grid"><div id="brxe-pioiyi" class="brxe-div nv-filosofia-intro-col"><div id="brxe-kv1gw2" class="brxe-div nv-section-eyebrow-wrapper"><span id="brxe-vuwz2h" class="brxe-div nv-section-eyebrow-line"><div id="brxe-mwpzvy" class="brxe-divider horizontal"><div class="line"></div></div></span><span id="brxe-fzqqb9" class="brxe-text-basic nv-section-eyebrow-text">Filosofia dello Spazio</span></div><h2 id="brxe-61a1jx" class="brxe-heading nv-section-main-title">Architettura dell'accoglienza, alchimia dello sguardo.</h2><p id="brxe-359187" class="brxe-text-basic nv-filosofia-intro-text">Il nostro concept store non è un salone convenzionale, ma un percorso sensoriale curato nel minimo dettaglio dall'architetto<a href="https://share.google/EOzoXEVU9Otobs7VQ"> <strong>Barbara Rigolio</strong></a>. Luce naturale modulata, acustica ovattata, materiali organici e profumazioni d'ambiente su misura trasformano ogni seduta in una meditazione estetica.</p></div><div id="brxe-m5owgp" class="brxe-div nv-filosofia-quotes-col"><div id="brxe-931c7n" class="brxe-div nv-quote-card"><div id="brxe-57z5yb" class="brxe-text-basic nv-quote-symbol">“</div><p id="brxe-4prl0l" class="brxe-text-basic nv-quote-text">La moda non è qualcosa che esiste solo negli abiti. La moda è nel cielo, nella strada, la moda ha a che fare con le idee, il nostro modo di vivere, che cosa sta accadendo.</p><div id="brxe-kcmty4" class="brxe-text-basic nv-quote-author">— Coco Chanel</div></div><div id="brxe-23x9rz" class="brxe-div nv-quote-card"><div id="brxe-b8su6g" class="brxe-text-basic nv-quote-symbol">“</div><p id="brxe-6g3af2" class="brxe-text-basic nv-quote-text">La forma è tutto. È il segreto della vita.</p><div id="brxe-n1z6pa" class="brxe-text-basic nv-quote-author">— Oscar Wilde</div></div></div></div><div id="brxe-2ykqju" class="brxe-div nv-filosofia-gallery-grid"><div id="brxe-zrh9ec" class="brxe-div nv-gallery-image-col"><div id="brxe-nzfnrk" class="brxe-div nv-gallery-image-wrapper"><img width="572" height="1024" src="https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-572x1024.jpeg" class="brxe-image nv-gallery-main-img css-filter size-large" alt="Metodo Total Emotion Hair SPA Nicole Vinti Gallarate" id="brxe-gbfoq4" decoding="async" data-type="string" sizes="(max-width: 572px) 100vw, 572px" srcset="https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-572x1024.jpeg 572w, https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-167x300.jpeg 167w, https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-768x1376.jpeg 768w, https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-857x1536.jpeg 857w, https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-1143x2048.jpeg 1143w, https://100100siti.it/nicolevinti/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beauty-Hair-SPA-Keratin-Treatment-Olaplex-e-Collagene-scaled.jpeg 1429w"><div id="brxe-nfpsnb" class="brxe-div nv-gallery-image-badge"><span id="brxe-y3zca7" class="brxe-text-basic">Spazio Rigenerativo • Gallarate</span></div></div></div><div id="brxe-jphq2c" class="brxe-div nv-gallery-card-col"><div id="brxe-hj9fft" class="brxe-div nv-total-emotion-card"><span id="brxe-1z5yoa" class="brxe-